OL,3,GNEWSAMan's parcel complaints trigger
OL,4,AEvri investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Folkestone man said he was left about
OL,7,F#2,000 out of pocket after parcels and
OL,8,Freturns handled by delivery company
OL,9,FEvri went missing.
OL,11,FAleksej Zemlanojs gathered CCTV
OL,12,Ffootage, tracking information and
OL,13,Fcorrespondence with retailers before
OL,14,Freporting his concerns to police.
OL,16,FKent Police said the matter was a civil
OL,17,Fissue and had earlier told Zemlanojs
OL,18,Fthere was insufficient evidence to
OL,19,Fprove a theft had taken place.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
