OL,3,GNEWSAMan's parcel complaints trigger
OL,4,AEvri investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvri said it investigated the
OL,7,Fallegations and that a driver working
OL,8,Ffor a third-party contractor would no
OL,9,Flonger be delivering on its behalf. The
OL,10,Fcompany also said it had identified
OL,11,F"inconsistencies in the customer's
OL,12,Faccount" and was investigating further.
